 [['source','Ambience source','Saved custom URL if present; otherwise manifest/local audio buffers. Empty URL restores default selection.']],
 [['tune','Ambience tuning','Intensity, gain, blur and spatial movement. Crossing above 5% gain asks confirmation; cancel restores prior display.']],
